  "summary": "Aesthetic effect of light patterns created when light passes through water and is refracted by its surface or objects within it.",
  "description": "Appears as shimmering, dancing patterns of light on underwater surfaces or pool bottoms, caused by refraction and reflection of light through water. Historically featured in Islamic architecture and later became a subject in scientific illustration and modern digital art.",
